<title>MEXICO: Bell Atlantic names president Iusacell.</title>
<headline>Bell Atlantic names president Iusacell.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tom Bartlett of Bell Atlantic was named new president and chief executive officer of Grupo Iusacell, majority owned by Grupo Iusa, Iusa said in a statement Wednesday.</p>
<p>The move followed the Mexican government's formal approval of the transfer of Iusacell's management to Bell Atlantic from Iusa on Feb. 12.</p>
</text>
